      "text": "Preliminary application: the site holds one occupied single-family residence (880 sq ft) to be demolished; zoning R-M-4,000; the project would seek a tentative map; part of the site is in the FEMA 100-year flood zone and the site is directly adjacent to Saratoga Creek. That application proposed 10 units (8 townhomes, 2 attached ADUs) and 16 covered parking spaces.",
